\title{Shared Shiny presentation components}
\description{Configurable application branding, home pages, compact controls, contextual help, plot themes, palettes, intrinsic sizes and PNG rendering. Statistical models and data processing belong to the consuming application.}
\details{Use \code{app_navbar}, \code{app_home_ui}, \code{app_sidebar} and \code{app_layout} for a branded application shell. \code{app_dependencies} supplies the common CSS and JavaScript as an HTML dependency. Explicit contextual help can be supplied with \code{app_help_ui} or \code{app_help_icon}. Plot sizes are logical screen pixels at 96 dpi; \code{save_plot_png} scales the same layout to its requested export resolution (300 dpi by default). See the bundled application template and component gallery in \code{system.file("templates", package="NicoShinyAppTemplate")} and \code{system.file("examples", package="NicoShinyAppTemplate")}.}
